<title>COLOMBIA: Banco de Colombia H1 net drops 46.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Banco de Colombia H1 net drops 46.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's Banco de Colombia SA, the country's second-largest bank in terms</p>
<p>of assets, on Wednesday posted the following first-half results:</p>
<p>		   First half 1997	   First half 1996</p>
<p>    Net income 18.3 billion pesos    Income 34.5 billion</p>
<p>Total assets 3.2 trillion pesos  Assets 2.6 trillion pesos</p>
<p>Loan portfolio 1.8 trillion pesos  1.59 trillion pesos</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Colombian pesos and subject to</p>
<p>verification by the Securities Superintendency.</p>
<p>((--Karl Penhaul, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
</text>
